<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND BEAT AUSTRALIA BY SIX WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND BEAT AUSTRALIA BY SIX WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>MANCHESTER, England 1997-05-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>England beat Australia by six wickets to win the second one-day international at Old Trafford on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 249-6 innings closed, England 253-4 off 48.2 overs.</p>
</text>
